# Solitaire (SOLITAIR.PRG) session on the text shell: sh tests/shots.sh EMU SD solitair 60 T1 ...
# Shot times (s): 5.5 6.8 11.0 14.5 17.4 20.4 58 (the same pictures with and without the blitter)
#   5.5  Klondike deal 3 as dealt (solitair -d 3)
#   6.8  the 6 of hearts dragged towards the 7 of spades (the button held)
#   11.0 dropped there; the ace of hearts sent home by a double click; three cards drawn;
#        the Options menu open (draw one marked)
#   14.5 Draw three cards (the deal again), red backs, three draws and an undo: two fans
#   17.4 Game > FreeCell, then Game > Choose deal...: 1 typed
#   20.4 FreeCell deal 1: the 4 of hearts dragged to a free cell; the queen of clubs and the
#        jack of hearts carried (it flies back when let go: no place takes them); Game > Close
#   58   "solitair -s": FreeCell deal 1 replayed to the end, the win (the cards in a ring)
# The pointer starts at (320, 180); the window's content is at (124, 38).
